Template: appblips/add-apt-source
Type: boolean
Default: false
Description: Get AppBlips updates through apt?
 Add the AppBlips package source to this computer, so new versions of AppBlips
 arrive with "sudo apt upgrade" and your software center. The source is
 https://techmitten.github.io/app-blips and is checked against a signing key
 that ships inside this package.
 .
 If you say no, AppBlips still tells you when a new version is out and links
 to the download.
